ん？ 潰す系？ え いい？
Hmm? Crush it? Wait, is this okay?

368
00:18:50,211 --> 00:18:52,711
これ目押しゲーってこと？
Does this mean it's a timing game?

369
00:18:53,011 --> 00:18:54,011
えい！
Ei!

370
00:18:54,011 --> 00:18:56,011
何？ これ目押しゲー？
What? Is this a timing game?

371
00:18:56,011 --> 00:18:58,411
これ何が正しいのじゃ？
What is the right thing to do here?

372
00:18:58,411 --> 00:18:59,711
これ何？ 目押しゲー？
What is this? A timing game?

373
00:18:59,711 --> 00:19:01,711
ゲーム ミニゲーム入ったのじゃ。のじゃ？
A game... We entered a mini-game. Right?

374
00:19:02,211 --> 00:19:03,211
ん？
Hmm?

375
00:19:03,211 --> 00:19:05,211
起立！
Stand up!

376
00:19:05,711 --> 00:19:06,511
はい！
Yes!

377
00:19:06,511 --> 00:19:08,711
礼！ 礼！
Bow! Bow!

378
00:19:09,211 --> 00:19:11,711
着席！
Sit down!

379
00:19:12,711 --> 00:19:15,211
