Director: Who wants to play Yellow?

511
00:25:34,253 --> 00:25:37,253
え、はいはいはい！やるやるやるやるやるやる！
Eh, yes, yes, yes! I'll do it, I'll do it!

512
00:25:37,253 --> 00:25:38,553
